                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3c4e92a-fe03-3b2c-a2f7-1238222b71d9",
                        "entry_id": "1745d836-6c3c-3fa1-90d7-2af14cdd8b26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "desolaat, somber, griezelig, op de dood betrekking hebbende"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c581e2a-19a3-4bef-90e9-1e9eab63f4a0",
                                "sense_id": "e3c4e92a-fe03-3b2c-a2f7-1238222b71d9",
                                "text": "Drie grote, zwarte vlakken waarop je als treinpassagier met een klaargelegd krijtje kunt schrijven wat je nog zou willen doen voordat je sterft. Dat kunstwerk uit 2011 van de Amerikaanse Candy Chang dat sinds deze maand staat opgesteld in het Gare de Lyon in Parijs, leidt in Frankrijk tot controverse. Treinreizigers vragen zich af of timing en plek van ’ wel passend zijn, na de recente aanslagen in Parijs en Nice. In Franse media wordt het kunstwerk ‘angstaanjagend’ en ‘macaber’ genoemd."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e4767a7-6ce3-4ccd-a5d5-189cee1d7123",
                        "source_entry_id": "1745d836-6c3c-3fa1-90d7-2af14cdd8b26",
                        "source_sense_id": "e3c4e92a-fe03-3b2c-a2f7-1238222b71d9",
                        "target_lang_word": "macabre",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "macabre",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f8e8f38-f56c-38b6-9c9c-58593a24167c",
                                        "entry_id": "6adb8bfc-3bd9-38ff-aaf8-d770dd0158ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Representing or personifying death."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a932010-ba9c-463c-a407-1504f6172a62",
                                                "sense_id": "2f8e8f38-f56c-38b6-9c9c-58593a24167c",
                                                "text": "There are four fundamental figures. One is a man measuring and comparing his world[…] In front of him is a macabre figure, a cadaver ready to be dissected. This symbolizes man serving mankind. The third figure is the scientist, the man who makes use of the information gathered in the first two fields of mensurable science."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c103996-e210-3cf4-8995-b731be627f73",
                                        "entry_id": "6adb8bfc-3bd9-38ff-aaf8-d770dd0158ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obsessed with death or the gruesome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15e5f722-a051-43a2-af91-572b20ee97bc",
                                                "sense_id": "3c103996-e210-3cf4-8995-b731be627f73",
                                                "text": "Indeed, in the 1854 draft of Tristan he planned to have Parzival visit the dying knight, and both operas display the same macabre obsession with bloody gore and festering wounds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c54f82bd-d85a-3656-a3e9-f8bea4114829",
                                        "entry_id": "6adb8bfc-3bd9-38ff-aaf8-d770dd0158ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ghastly, shocking, terrifying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42cdef96-6c7d-42f0-9b00-ce264f674aec",
                                                "sense_id": "c54f82bd-d85a-3656-a3e9-f8bea4114829",
                                                "text": "The appeal of the spectrally macabre is generally narrow because it demands from the reader a certain degree of imagination and a capacity for detachment from every-day life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5dbfebee-5c42-4255-9df6-55e72e402cbe",
                        "source_entry_id": "1745d836-6c3c-3fa1-90d7-2af14cdd8b26",
                        "source_sense_id": "e3c4e92a-fe03-3b2c-a2f7-1238222b71d9",
                        "target_lang_word": "macabro",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "macabro",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c19ee5d8-328e-38d0-8dc6-4f83ebe7dadd",
                                        "entry_id": "a8280724-6cb9-3d9b-b81e-71af770372f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que produce emociones de repulsión similares a las que producen los cadáveres y lo mortuorio, o que tiene características asociadas con ello."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d5ade62-cad4-462d-a114-6096663ced78",
                                                "sense_id": "c19ee5d8-328e-38d0-8dc6-4f83ebe7dadd",
                                                "text": "Una zorra lanzaba a ratos su eructo macabro y estridente"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8aa42010-6e5d-3496-ae17-edea3a8edc90",
                                        "entry_id": "a8280724-6cb9-3d9b-b81e-71af770372f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dice también de la persona que gusta cosas relacionadas con la muerte, lo funerario y lo cadavérico."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2fba0f4b-58ea-3531-839c-bb57537d267d",
                                        "entry_id": "a8280724-6cb9-3d9b-b81e-71af770372f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se aplica a un género literario en que se privilegian los temas relacionados con la muerte, lo fantasmal, el misterio y lo cadavérico."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
